ity for a few days. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Life's tough when you're a millionaire! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Check out this jacket I bought in Paris! It's by a French designer!", "time": "13500", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn5le18ob02re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: How much was that?! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh ... about $2000, I think. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You know what? It looks just like Peter's old jacket! The one he ripped last year, remember? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hmm ... you're right!", "time": "26000", "id": 3}, {"image": "engenn5le18ob02re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: He probably didn't pay more than $40, knowing Peter and his budget problems. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Maybe I should give it to him as a gift ... a blast from the past! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh, Sally. You're too much!", "time": "40000", "id": 4}, {"image": "engenn5le18ob02re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Where is he, anyway? Isn't he supposed to be coming over? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Let me text him. He's so forgetful ...", "time": "52750", "id": 5}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}